• Whether you can set binlog_format=MIXED on the source DB (allowing the simple plain-SQL shell script above), or if the source is locked to ROW
• Which cloud provider hosts your managed databases (some providers have built-in Data Transmission / DMS services that connect managed-to-managed natively)
